# Plan a job without moving the robot or changing its mode: /cleaning/preview. The rows are
# published on /cleaning/plan (unless a job is running). With what = PLAN this loads a saved plan.
CleaningJob job
---
bool success
string message                # why not, or a note about the plan
bool replanned                # a saved plan's rows were planned again because the map has changed
CleaningEstimate estimate
